"Modified Work" means the Software or any portion of it that has been changed, adapted, translated, extended, or combined into a derivative version.
"Publicly Available" means accessible to the general public, without a fee, account requirement, or restrictive access control, in a repository or other source-code hosting location that permits inspection and download of the complete corresponding source.
"Commercial Purpose" means an activity primarily intended for monetary compensation, commercial advantage, or revenue generation from the Software or access to functionality materially provided by it.
"Hosted Service" means making the Software, or a substantially similar modified version, available for use by third parties as a hosted, managed, or remotely operated service.

